{
  "$comment": "The one shared paper puppet. Rig units: standing height = 1.0. A flat doll in its local XY plane: +x is the way it faces, +y is up. Every bone rotates about z, radians, counter-clockwise positive seen from the front. See shared/CONTRACTS.md.",
